{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"You’ve learned to use the weight of your weapons effectively, and have adapted to using large weapons in one hand.\n\n- Increase your Strength score by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- When wielding a versatile weapon in one hand, you may use the two-handed damage die. \n\n- You can wield a two-handed melee weapon in one hand, treating it as a one-handed weapon.\n\n- When wielding a two handed or versatile melee weapon with both hands, you may add half your Strength modifier (rounded up, to a minimum of 1) to it\u0027s damage rolls.","level":1}],"id":"Custom226fff19-003a-4b59-b339-db9c3cc6ff8b","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Brutal Grip [VSS] [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}